{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://crqse.github.io/worldloop/", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>WorldLoop \u2014 agents propose, the world adjudicates</title>\n  <style>\n    :root { --ink:#1c1e21; --muted:#6b7177; --accent:#2b6cb0; --bg:#fafbfc; }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { margin:0; font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:var(--ink); background:var(--bg); }\n    header { padding:56px 20px 24px; text-align:center; }\n    header h1 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:2.1rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.01em; }\n    header p { margin:0 auto; max-width:720px; color:var(--muted); }\n    .badges { margin-top:16px; }\n    .badges img { height:20px; margin:0 2px; vertical-align:middle; }\n    main { max-width:860px; margin:0 auto; padding:16px 20px 64px; }\n    .grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap:16px; margin-top:28px; }\n    .card { background:#fff; border:1px solid #e6e8eb; border-radius:12px; padding:20px; text-decoration:none; color:inherit; transition:box-shadow .15s ease, transform .15s ease; display:block; }\n    .card:hover { box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(27,31,35,.08); transform:translateY(-2px); }\n    .card h2 { margin:0 0 6px; font-size:1.05rem; }\n    .card p { margin:0; color:var(--muted); font-size:.92rem; }\n    footer { text-align:center; color:var(--muted); font-size:.85rem; padding:32px 20px; }\n    a { color:var(--accent); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <h1>WorldLoop</h1>\n    <p>An environment-authoritative multi-agent simulation &amp; trajectory-data\n       system. Agents (or LLMs) only <strong>propose</strong>; a deterministic\n       world <strong>adjudicates</strong> every consequence \u2014 replayable,\n       branchable, counterfactually comparable.</p>\n    <div class=\"badges\">\n      <img alt=\"Python 3.10-3.12\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10--3.12-3776AB\">\n      <img alt=\"MIT\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-23aaff\">\n      <img alt=\"deterministic replay\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/replay-deterministic-brightgreen\">\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <main>\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <a class=\"card\" href=\"examples/assets/emergency_scheduling.html\">\n        <h2>Interactive demo</h2>\n        <p>Emergency-resource scheduling simulation \u2014 open in your browser.</p>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://github.com/Crqse/worldloop/blob/main/examples/quickstart.ipynb\">\n        <h2>Quickstart notebook</h2>\n        <p>Replay + counterfactual branch, side-by-side (rendered on GitHub).</p>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://github.com/Crqse/worldloop\">\n        <h2>README &amp; source</h2>\n        <p>Install, the four packages, evidence &amp; boundaries.</p>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://github.com/Crqse/worldloop/blob/main/examples/discrete_grid.yaml\">\n        <h2>Example scenario</h2>\n        <p>discrete_grid.yaml \u2014 a readable, compile-time-validated rule set.</p>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <footer>\n    MIT License \u00b7 built on the principle that the environment is authoritative.\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n", "erro": "", "ms": 360}